        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Paul McCartney, Denny Laine\n- Groups: Wings, the Beatles\n- Products: \"No Words\", Band on the Run\n- Topics: album and song releases\n\nFacts:\n- Paul McCartney left the Beatles in April 1970.\n- Band on the Run was Paul McCartney's fifth album after his departure from the Beatles.\n- Band on the Run was the third studio album by Paul McCartney and Wings.\n- Band on the Run was released in December 1973.\n- \"No Words\" was written by Paul McCartney and Denny Laine.\n- \"No Words\" was first released on 7 December 1973 on Band on the Run by Paul McCartney and Wings.",
